text_3:
  id: "tuno_stjudenta"
  veljano_title: "Lä tunô dè zïi stjudenta"
  english_title: "A Day in the Life of a Student"

  veljano: |
    Mark gëauzonwezë a zïivzs jèrhöt. Hï ajmajdwes gëstojwol së. Hïm bajto warmwa abön cyjmo halidwa. 
    Hï zejwe a tëlïfonö. Län lecwe së 7:05. Hï ahwes baj zejswezë. Hï gwe zum vannöj. 
    Hï mülwezë baj wajswe lïikwo. Hï ojwes mojwï baj djankwe: «Ïjm nöd wïll gëluihairwol».
    Hï gwes zum kuhcymöj, hïm mamma'ns wïll län. Ŝï gëkoffïnwes. 
    Ŝï tajnwe: «Bon matyna, Mark. Sonwu tü lui?» Hï tajnwe: «ajnöä-lui Ïj lïgwïns zer ŝpatet».
    Hï matyjesswezë. Hï mälwes brodwo battonod baj kèjzod. Hï kofïnwes. 
    Mamma kwastwes: «èjs tüm ŝujlo najtumô pällwe?»
    Hï tajnwe: «Matëmatïkïijca, hïstorïica, baj ïnglïŝïica. Ajnkajmanwa».
    Hï gëjodwezë. Hï shörtwe së karulïnas baj blekas dżynswe së. Hï ïblèjğwezë rükzakot. 
    Hï ajwes mït mammäd baj auzdjomwes.
    Drauset rejnwe. Markö ajne zonto. Hï gëkapüŝönwes baj gwe fjast. Drauso halidwa baj grèjwa. 
    On äwlojntwezë mïlet. Lojt gwe zontwenwa. Hï gwe ïr zum bussŝtopöj. 
    Län wïll fjati lojt. Auswïllwa jèla dajwezë lïtwa jündwo. Jaltïino hörwe müzïikwo. 
    Mark gestojwes für bussor.
    Gëbusswezë a 7:40. Hï moirwa dè lojt. Mark stojwe u dürö. Hï dajwezë tïkwo. 
    Busso lälät gwes ïn moirlojèntön. Ïn ŝujlö Mark gwe a adjamwa mmmö. Èjz'll matëmetïkïijca. 
    Palüläto lecwes cijütot en lä deskö. Mark ajnvföŝtejwe. 
    Hï kwastwes amïkot: «vföŝtejwöjz tü?» Amïko tajnwe: «najn, alliwa najn».
    Djevïnwa nïico'll hïstorïica. Palüläto zagwe o Alidwa Rïma. Mark lajdwe hïstorwï. 
    Hï zamltkwes en kulïibrö. Hï kulliwe troja tejxtokwo.
    A abedö Mark zejswes mït amïciïd. Zïi jesswezë önbrüdwot baj tajnwez o fusbali. 
    Hïm amïko Alëx tajnwes: «Tü vïzzwuns jügtunwa kjonwï?» Mark tajnwe: «nejn, Ïj lejnwïn së». 
    Alëx tajmwe: «tü adiüstojwun lui plejö».
    Ön abëdö Mark päll Ïnglïŝïica. Palüläto pratajn für hï lïbrïnwe tejxtwï. 
    Hï lïbrïnwe lälät baj we djev fjatwo. Palüläto zag: «Najleco, Mark. Prajyl».
    A troja jarhe lïi ŝujla auswe së. Mark gwes djomöj'm. Dażdiwens auz. Gëaussolwe. 
    Hï gëmödwa abön radwa.
    Djomö hï Adiüämwe. Hï ĉajwes baj jesswezë tretot. Mamma kwastwes: «Èjs beljanto a ŝujlö?» 
    Hï anszag: «Normali. Ïj gëmödwns».
    Hï gwes zum sëm zymö. Hï djomarbajtwes. Hï soĉïnënwe o Rïma. Èjz'll we së adjam jarhe. 
    Hï ojprave tëlïfojnwo. Hï päll troja ŝajwo ans Alëx.
    Hï anszag für amŝajor. Jafte hï lïgs ön bajtö. Hï djank o tuna. 
    Hï djankwe o tejsta für matëmatïkër lec zïivzstagö. Hï lälät änfjatwe.
    Marhen hï marjesswe mït sëmïad. Ämwez züipwo baj brodwo. Alve tajn o sëm arbajta. 
    Mamma tajn o gjarda. Mark hör baj äm.
    Ön marhjesso hï zejwe fïlimwï mït sïstad. Èjz'lkjomedïi. Zïi hahwe moi. 
    Sïsta tajn: «Èjz'll bon fïlim». Hï tajn: «Je, ï lajdwï au».
    A vfön jarhe hï gësonwes. Hï rïdwe lïbrïnwï djevlïhi majnut. Jafte hï mïlwes hei. 
    Hï ausojwes. Hï djankwe: «Ömajtun luïmwajur»

  english: |
    Mark wakes up at seven o'clock. He does not want to get up. His bed is warm, but the room is cold. 
    He looks at his phone. It says 7:05. He sighs and sits up.
    He goes to the bathroom. He washes his face and brushes his teeth. The water is cold. 
    He looks in the mirror and thinks, "I need a haircut."
    He goes to the kitchen. His mother is already there. She is making coffee. 
    She says, "Good morning, Mark. Did you sleep well?" He says, "Not really. I went to bed too late."
    He eats breakfast. He has bread with butter and cheese. He drinks a cup of coffee. 
